      "content": "thanks. u mentioned europe/greece/rome first and then just a quick mention of the others. can u go deeper into the chinese and islamic stuff? like specifically what were their biggest wins in science or math that actually changed how things worked globally. i want to make sure my project shows it wasn't just one part of the world doing everything.",
